{"id":"540026307","kind":"article","title":"择校","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_choice"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-07-11","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":12,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":367,"keywords":["择校","家庭教育","非学校教育","学习内驱力","厌学"],"summary":"词条把择校界定为在公立、私立、家庭教育等方式间提供真实而多元的选择，认为选择能适配个体的学习内驱力，并有助于缓解厌学。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/540026307","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"6ud3_Lbe\"><b>择校</b>是指在接受教育方面的广泛选择。如果教育系统允许在公立学校、私立学校、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeschooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">家庭教育</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Democratic_school\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">民主学校教育</a>或<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Unschooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">非学校教育</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>中进行平等和多元的选择，我们就可以称之为<b>丰富的择校</b>。“择校”在世界各地有许多实现方式。所有的教育系统都给予了一定范围的选择，然而，只有实现丰富的选择才值得被标记为<b>择校</b>。择校是能够帮助补救几乎普遍存在的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Why_kids_hate_school?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">厌学</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>问题的关键工具之一。选择对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的要求提供了一定程度的适应，这也是遵守<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Fundamental_law_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的基本规律</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>的要求。</p><p data-pid=\"_eUaSwFM\">另见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"HrcIRMur\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Grand_Education_Reform\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教育改革</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"gzwyXQrQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/School_choice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">维基百科：择校</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"54-bH4Ny\">本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语</a>条目用于解释《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Problem_of_Schooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我永远不会送我的孩子去学校</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>》<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>（2017）作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">彼得·沃兹尼亚克</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"gGhoUAGq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_choice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">School choice - supermemo.guru</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 民主学校/在家上学/非学校教育 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"369568521\" href=\"#/post/369568521\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 为什么孩子们讨厌学校？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"70779863\" href=\"#/post/70779863\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 教育改革 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"242815901\" href=\"#/post/242815901\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 《我永远不会送我的孩子去学校》 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 学校教育的问题 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"611469462\" href=\"#/post/611469462\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"539815922","title":"谬误：青少年憎恨一切","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"540927308","title":"卓越的能力在多大程度上是可以遗传的？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":7,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"70779863","title":"20 孩子们为什么讨厌学校？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2798075773","title":"请问中国式教育有多悲哀?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":703,"minutes":34,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 703 赞同","evidence":"回答正文以原生链接锚点“择校”明确指向该译文；这只支持标题/关键词提及。"},{"id":"3040571508","title":"UBI（Universal basic income，全民基本收入）可行吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":544,"minutes":30,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 544 赞同","evidence":"回答正文有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"},{"id":"3029922725","title":"为什么，所有人都在骂应试教育，却没有人有实际的办法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":310,"minutes":34,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 310 赞同","